                  "snippet": "## Long Dragon’s Back Walk龍脊段\n\n...\n\n| What must be one of the most beautiful hiking trails in the world, this is perhaps the most impressive stage of the HK Coastal Trail. You’re in for a steep climb and a real treat. From up the ‘Dragon’s Back’ the city seems miles away, the trail offers sweeping views of grassy mountains, the stunning Shek O and ends at popular surf beach Big Wave Bay. | 龍脊段全長8.5公里。路段連接着一部分的港島徑第八段、砵甸乍山郊遊徑和龍躍徑。此路段途徑經著名的山徑－龍脊。山友能夠輕易一賞港島另類的郊野景色的同時，其景色的優美更不遜於西貢的景色。 |\n| --- | --- |\n\n...\n\n| Deity Beach > Hong Kong Island Trail Stage 8 > Pottinger Peak Country Trail > Leaping Dragon Walk > Siu Sai Wan Promenade | 土地灣 > 港島徑第八段 > 砵甸乍山郊遊徑 > 龍躍徑 > 小西灣海濱花園 |\n| --- | --- |",
